WEBVTT

NOTE
Deling City parade — Edea's float arrives at the presidential residence while the SeeD team infiltrates underground. Dancers, fireworks, and cheering crowds fill the plaza.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
An arched stone corridor ends at ornate iron gates — the underground route to the residence.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Boots march across red carpet. The SeeD team moves into position.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Outside, the crowd cheers as Edea's parade float approaches amid fireworks.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Dancers in plaid costumes perform before the residence gates as the float draws near.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The camera sweeps past ironwork, then reveals Edea on her golden throne, flames beside her.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Close-up of Edea. Amber eyes, spiral headdress, black feather collar, wreathed in fire.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Dancers surround the float as the residence entrance glows green and violet.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Aerial view. Massive braziers, a magical display, and fireworks light the packed plaza.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:55.000
The glowing float towers over the adoring crowd as fireworks cascade above.
